docs {
  # TeachingService.AutoFill

  Fills the missing hours of a section (or of every section) without putting a teacher in two places at once

  `/ltedu.teaching.v1.TeachingService/AutoFill` · unary · `ltedu/teaching/v1/teaching.proto`

  ## Request — `AutoFillRequest`

  | Campo | Tipo | Descripción |
  |---|---|---|
  | `institution_slug` | `string` |  |
  | `period_id` | `string` |  |
  | `section_id` | `string` | Empty: every section of the period |

  ## Response — `AutoFillResponse`

  | Campo | Tipo | Descripción |
  |---|---|---|
  | `placed` | `int32` |  |
  | `pending` | `int32` |  |

  Errores: status gRPC con un `ltedu.common.v1.ErrorDetail` (code, message, fields) en los details.
}
